      "acceptance_id": "A1",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "packages/pi-quiet-spinner/src/index.ts:137–143 的 parseInterval 只验证十进制字符和正数，接受超过计时器上限的值，甚至接受转换后为 Infinity 的值。Node 会将溢出的 setInterval 延迟改为 1 ms，导致减速配置反而显著增加刷新频率。应校验 Number.isSafeInteger(value) 且 1 <= value <= 2147483647，错误中保留原值，并补充边界测试。",
      "anchor": "sha256:60249e58215230569699614ce0f141feed0bcc0fa7e9fe6c9defa0177381d385",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "默认 quiet 预设下设置 PI_QUIET_SPINNER_INTERVAL_MS=\"2147483648\"，或设置为由 400 个数字 9 组成的字符串；parseInterval 均不会抛错，后者转换为 Infinity，配置随后传入多帧 Loader 的计时器。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "packages/pi-quiet-spinner/src/index.ts:default",
          "packages/pi-quiet-spinner/src/index.ts:resolveOptions",
          "packages/pi-quiet-spinner/src/index.ts:parseInterval",
          "packages/pi-quiet-spinner/src/index.ts:installQuietSpinner",
          "packages/pi-quiet-spinner/src/index.ts:proto.restartAnimation"
        ],
        "violated": {
